  { q: 'Do you cover all CH postcodes?', a: 'Yes. We cover the whole Wirral, from Wallasey and Birkenhead to Hoylake, West Kirby, Heswall, Neston and Eastham. The price is the same in every CH postcode, with no travel charge.' },
  { q: 'Do you do power flushing in Bromborough?', a: 'Yes. Bromborough is one of our busiest Wirral areas for flushing. Many CH62 homes from the 1970s to 1990s have microbore pipes. We flush them at the same fixed prices.' },
