            <tr><td data-label="Job"><strong>Power flush, 11 to 15 radiators</strong></td><td data-label="Price inc VAT">£675</td><td data-label="Typical Wirral home">4 and 5-bed homes in Heswall, West Kirby and Neston</td></tr>
